    "body": "Other suggested changes:\r\n- Replace \"return from this algorithm and run the remaining steps\" wording with explicit callbacks (https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8264#discussion_r980841656)\r\n- In _fetch a classic script_ (and maybe also in the other algorithms that perform the fetch), we pass the same callback as _processResponseConsumeBody_ and _processCustomFetchResponse_; however, they have different signatures (https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8264#discussion_r980842517)",
