    "updated_at": "2022-12-26T10:02:37Z",
    "body": "This is mostly done at this point; hooray!\r\n\r\nI think the only remaining stuff is:\r\n\r\n- Potentially landing https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7862, while figuring out its relation to \"is top-level\".\r\n- Change all variables and parameters to use modern camelCasing style, instead of the current mix.\r\n- Consider adding types to all the parameter declarations, like most modern algorithms do.",
